# Failure notice setting of the tipping-point units (tipping-point-notify@.service).
# Install as /etc/tipping-point/notify.env, owner root, mode 0600. A webhook URL is
# a secret (it often holds a token), and this file holds nothing else: the notice
# unit does not read the secrets of the data jobs. Names only here; never put a real
# value in the repository, in a chat or in a log. One KEY=value per line, no quotes.
#
# Optional: an https:// URL that receives one short plain-text POST when a
# tipping-point unit fails. Unset (or no file): no network call, the failed unit
# and the journal are the only signal.
NOTIFY_WEBHOOK_URL=
# NOTIFY_MIN_INTERVAL_S=3600
